ved_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-04T22:22:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T09:35:52Z","closed_at":"2025-07-24T23:21:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot Engine v4.4.1.stable.official.49a5bc7b6\nVulkan 1.3.289 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Qualcomm - Turnip Adreno (TM) 650\n\nWindows and all derivatives always change transient to true after popup even when set to false.\n\nRunning in native Linux X11 Arm64\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Armbian 25.2.3 noble 24.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Turnip Adreno (TM) 650 -  (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nCreating a Window or any subclass and setting transient to false is reset to true as soon as popup() is called.\nIt seems odd that one can manually set this propertie, but it always resets itself.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a Control node and add a Window node\nSet transient manually to false\n\n\nexecute this code inside of `_ready()`:\n\n```\n$Window.transient = false\nprint(\"Before Popup Transient: \" + str($Window.transient))\n$Window.popup()\nprint(\"After Popup Transient: \" + str($Window.transient))\n```\n\n\nThis will give the following output:\n\n\n1 Transient: false\n2 Transient: true\n\n\n\nThis doesn't seem like an intended behavior.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[trasient_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19610794/trasient_test.zip)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Dr4kzor","id":51714674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzE0Njc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51714674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor","html_url":"https://github.com/Dr4kzor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dr4kzor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105033/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}